        "ratings": [
            {
                "comment": "Prof Tochon is an amazing professor. His interest is broad. I like his usage digital media as a teaching platform and his attention to students' individual needs.",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
                "quality_rating": 4
            },
            {
                "comment": "He was very kind and well versed in teaching methods, had his own approach but did not impose it. He showed flexibility when I had to leave early for a parents' conference and provided useful tips on how to handle the situation. He has been very patient with my portfolio, and when finished, gave me feedback overnight. I'll keep a good souvenir.",
                "difficulty_rating": 2,
                "quality_rating": 4
            },
            {
                "comment": "Prof. Tochon is a great professor. He knows his discipline well. The reading list for this course is amazing. I have never learned this much in a class. He provides with a solid background through readings, and builds on that during his class. He is also friendly and encouraging. BEST professor ever. Take his class, you'll know what I mean.",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Deep Education spiced with a transdisciplinary approach. Outstanding list of readings. Open seminar style. Lots of readings each week, but neatly selected. Open to criticisms, frequent fascinating debates. A couple of books to buy (I found one used for $1.29 plus shipping on Amazon), the rest on course reserves organized per week.",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Large variety of papers on the course reserves; most-up-to-date literature relevant to linguistic human rights and globalization; videos from previous courses for two distance meetings during the semester; great connections to researchers in the field; well organized seminar; very knowledgeable guy: he knows his stuff! Very humane.",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
